  "id": "ea",
  "term": "EA",
  "definition": "EA refers to experienced appreciation in social interactions, especially at work: the extent to which a person feels valued by others such as colleagues or supervisors. In the source, it is described as a single overall experience that is linked with higher self-esteem, satisfaction, and engagement, and with lower stress and emotional exhaustion.",
